      "uid": "zhcn:04bc3145e88b571f7ba816e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "像巨石那样的大作我是做不出来的。反复的尝试与失败……\n努力的尽头，终于做出来的……是平平无奇的普通巧克力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd847a6bbee4d1c7b263da88982008c599fb8ede93e8a67423e44331e739f035",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
