      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c56c4278ddcffabeb801fb50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将各自的『祝福』倾注于花朵中，扎成花束，互相赠予。\n我想将其打造成这样的『直道舞会』――我是这么想的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f8ee97b4ebe8708a5f9d2bd25e455331fb51083627f14b9ec42becba6ead8f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec2b7c410861302c8285be6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "舞会执行委员长",
      "source_fingerprint": "f92fdc4cf69228491fdbecb38074ef0f81a480d05a20ae9428c567d7becc723f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052001.json",
      "json_path": [
